{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-11-01 19:53:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF MEDTRONIC PLC - MDT', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - NOVEMBER 1, 2022) - POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF MEDTRONIC PLC (""MEDTRONIC" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: MDT). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S. WILLOUGHBY AT NEWACTION@POMLAW.COM OR 888-476-6529, EXT. 7980.THE INVESTIGATION CONCERNS WHETHER MEDTRONIC AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS AND/OR DIRECTORS HAVE ENGAGED IN SECURITIES FRAUD OR OTHER UNLAWFUL BUSINESS PRACTICES.'}{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-11-01 16:51:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC CLASS ACTION: LEVI & KORSINSKY REMINDS MEDTRONIC PLC INVESTORS OF THE PENDING CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT WITH A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF NOVEMBER 7, 2022 - MDT', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - NOVEMBER 1, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN MEDTRONIC PLC ("MEDTRONIC" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: MDT) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF MEDTRONIC INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE DISTRICT OF MINNESOTA.'}{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-11-01 05:45:00', 'title': 'MDT ALERT: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF NOVEMBER 7, 2022 IN THE CLASS ACTION FILED ON BEHALF OF MEDTRONIC PLC SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , NOV. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION COMPLAINT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE: MDT) ALLEGING THAT THE COMPANY VIOLATED FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF PERSONS AND ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED MEDTRONIC COMMON STOCK BETWEEN JUNE 8, 2019, AND MAY 25, 2022, INCLUSIVE.LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: NOVEMBER 7, 2022 NO OBLIGATION OR COST TO YOU.'}